     1506     define output parameter p-section-num    as integer no-undo .
     1507     do
     1508     on error undo, return error return-value
     1509     :
     1510           if (valid-handle(g#attr-lib) <> true) then do:   run gbl/attr-lib.p persistent no-error .   if error-status :error or (valid-handle(g#attr-lib) <> true) then do:     message       "Error starting attr-lib.p" skip       g#attr-lib skip       g#attr-lib :type skip       g#attr-lib :file-name skip       error-status :get-message(1) skip       return-value skip       view-as alert-box error .     stop .   end. end. run cd-attr-batch-edit in g#attr-lib
     1511         (input  p-ucode
     1512         ,input  p-code
